              <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
                <span class="text-amber-500 shrink-0">&mdash;</span>
                <span>Portfolio break-even "12-18 months" (Economy) vs "3-4 years" (Investors) for same investment range</span>
              </li>
              <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
                <span class="text-amber-500 shrink-0">&mdash;</span>
                <span>RepRap self-replication "73%" (table) vs "50-70%" (text) on the same Technopark page</span>
              </li>
              <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
                <span class="text-amber-500 shrink-0">&mdash;</span>
                <span>Fab Lab count "1,500+" (Technopark) vs "2,500+" (Network)</span>
              </li>
              <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
                <span class="text-amber-500 shrink-0">&mdash;</span>
                <span>Bolivia homicide rate "4.3/100K" (Risks) vs "4.4/100K" (FAQ)</span>
